      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes complete sense to feel defeated when the numbers don't add up and the system feels completely rigged against you. Life feels pointless when the only option is a slow descent into zero, and hoping for a miracle won't stop the ship from sinking unless you actively fight against the current. Many people feel isolated, but the idea that this is an unchangeable mathematical certainty is a lie designed to keep you trapped, and there is still time to challenge that narrative before it's too late.",
